Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.65,0:00:45.28,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}...was now covered with many spots of sunlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.28,0:00:50.50,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf27}bo{\kf21}ku {\kf40}hi{\kf45}to{\kf43}ri {\kf85}ga {\kf24}ko{\kf22}ko {\kf43}de {\kf35}ya{\kf41}sa{\kf41}shi{\kf55}i
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.28,0:00:50.50,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}I'm standing here alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.50,0:00:58.17,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf21}a{\kf21}ta{\kf44}ta{\kf35}ka{\kf55}sa {\kf80}wo {\kf19}o{\kf27}mo{\kf44}i {\kf45}ka{\kf34}e{\kf96}shi{\kf24}te{\kf190}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.50,0:00:58.17,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}remembering all the heart-warming memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.17,0:01:05.84,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,0)}{\kf45}ki{\kf47}mi {\kf61}da{\kf65}ke {\kf197}wo  {\kf24}ki{\kf65}mi {\kf61}da{\kf26}ke {\kf176}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.17,0:01:05.84,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,0)}You were the one... You were the one...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.84,0:01:12.07,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf78}su{\kf67}ki {\kf214}de {\kf65}i{\kf65}ta{\kf129}yo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.84,0:01:12.07,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...who I loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.07,0:01:19.82,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf44}ka{\kf43}ze {\kf64}de {\kf62}me {\kf211}ga {\kf71}ni{\kf67}ji{\kf26}n{\kf185}de
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.07,0:01:19.82,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}My eyes start to water from the wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.82,0:01:26.78,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf89}to{\kf44}o{\kf201}ku {\kf84}na{\kf59}ru {\kf219}yo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.82,0:01:26.78,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}and you become a distant figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.78,0:01:29.08,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}{\kf14}i{\kf28}tsu{\kf23}ma{\kf21}de{\kf22}mo {\kf14}o{\kf26}bo{\kf25}e{\kf23}te{\kf20}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.78,0:01:29.08,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I will always remember...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.91,0:01:31.20,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf22}na{\kf18}ni{\kf21}mo {\kf26}ka{\kf21}mo {\kf27}ka{\kf18}wa{\kf19}t{\kf22}te{\kf19}mo
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.91,0:01:31.20,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}...no matter the changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.07,0:01:33.41,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf19}hi{\kf19}to{\kf26}tsu {\kf20}da{\kf19}ke {\kf23}hi{\kf19}to{\kf24}tsu {\kf23}da{\kf20}ke
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.07,0:01:33.41,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}Just this one thing, this one thing,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.19,0:01:35.92,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}{\kf24}a{\kf23}ri{\kf20}fu{\kf23}re{\kf19}ta {\kf18}mo{\kf21}no {\kf21}da{\kf29}ke{\kf40}do
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.19,0:01:35.92,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,250)}though it's a plain thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.59,0:01:39.88,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf25}mi{\kf18}se{\kf25}te {\kf22}ya{\kf19}ru {\kf18}ka{\kf21}ga{\kf23}ya{\kf23}ki {\kf20}ni {\kf17}mi{\kf26}chi{\kf14}ta {\kf27}so{\kf26}no {\kf15}hi{\kf23}to{\kf28}tsu {\kf22}da{\kf16}ke
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.59,0:01:39.88,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}I will show it to you, this one thing covered in glory.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.88,0:01:45.13,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}{\kf19}i{\kf28}tsu{\kf21}ma{\kf27}de{\kf17}mo {\kf14}i{\kf32}tsu{\kf19}ma{\kf21}de{\kf17}mo {\kf23}ma{\kf23}mo{\kf22}t{\kf16}te {\kf27}i{\kf200}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.88,0:01:45.13,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,500)}Forever and ever, I shall hold it dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.67,0:01:49.80,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,So, what was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.80,0:01:50.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What was what about?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.18,0:01:53.10,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Mei-chan's still around, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.10,0:01:55.81,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,It looked like you two were having fun yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.81,0:02:00.60,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,We spoke about what could be going on after seeing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.60,0:02:03.44,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I want to play with Mei-chan, as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.44,0:02:06.69,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,I want to let her listen to the violin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.69,0:02:09.15,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I think that's a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.36,0:02:12.03,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Kyou-chan's a bully.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.03,0:02:15.24,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Mei-chan's worried about Sunohara-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.24,0:02:17.33,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,We talked about it last night, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.08,0:02:20.04,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,But I think that's the only chance. {ep 3}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.62,0:02:25.96,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,If he plays soccer again,\Nmaybe he'll return to the way he used to be. {ep 3}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.30,0:02:28.05,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Huh? Talk about the impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.05,0:02:31.93,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,There's no way he could return to the soccer team now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.93,0:02:33.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I told her the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.93,0:02:38.73,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You know well what kind of group our Soccer Team is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.73,0:02:42.19,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,It's best you stay away from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.56,0:02:46.90,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Yes, since our school's Soccer Team is a little special.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.90,0:02:48.86,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Are they bullies?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.86,0:02:52.82,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,For once, your pet phrase actually fits.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.16,0:02:56.83,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\pos(960,410.000015)\3c&H4A8A5C&}Episode 4
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.16,0:02:56.83,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}With the Same Smile as That Day
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.58,0:02:58.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He wasn't in the dorm, either?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.87,0:03:03.25,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,No. Even Misae-san doesn't know where he went.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.25,0:03:08.63,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,What should we do? Without the actual person, we can't ask them to let him rejoin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.09,0:03:11.63,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Mei-chan, let's think it over. {ep3}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.63,0:03:14.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I think the chance of this working is slim.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.97,0:03:19.60,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I'll go on ahead and ask them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.60,0:03:21.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,"Go ahead", as in to the Soccer Team?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.35,0:03:24.94,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Yes. You two wait here please.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.94,0:03:26.48,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I'll go by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.48,0:03:27.73,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.73,0:03:29.11,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,How could we let you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.11,0:03:32.20,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,If you're going to go, then we will, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.62,0:03:43.08,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Did you just say Sunohara Youhei?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.25,0:03:46.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Winter's the critical season for high school soccer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.79,0:03:49.42,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Even a senior should be able to participate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.42,0:03:52.13,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Could you let him play again?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.76,0:03:54.34,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Shut your trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.34,0:03:56.72,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,We don't even want to hear his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.72,0:03:57.60,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.60,0:03:58.18,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Um!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.68,0:04:02.06,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,My name is Mei, Sunohara Youhei's younger sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.98,0:04:05.23,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Sunohara's younger sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.23,0:04:08.23,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I'm aware how my brother has caused trouble to you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.23,0:04:09.94,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,But please!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.94,0:04:12.90,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,At this rate, I think he will become a loafer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.90,0:04:13.61,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,So!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.61,0:04:17.07,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,He was a loafer to begin with.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.07,0:04:21.20,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Yeah. A loafer will always be\Na loafer no matter what he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.20,0:04:26.17,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Okazaki. You're the same as him,\Nso don't you understand that logic?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.67,0:04:28.34,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,And you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.34,0:04:31.55,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,You're repeating a grade and are an outcast, too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.01,0:04:36.39,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Loafers should hang out with loafers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.59,0:04:38.68,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.60,0:04:48.23,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sorry. I should have gone there alone first.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.61,0:04:51.32,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.32,0:04:53.99,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Both of you had to suffer because of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.99,0:04:57.07,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No, we're fine. Rather...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.07,0:04:59.24,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Would you like another cup, Mei-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.95,0:05:02.20,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Yes, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.20,0:05:04.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sorry we're imposing on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.75,0:05:09.04,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I had a feeling you would listen to something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.38,0:05:11.21,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,I'm completely fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.21,0:05:16.22,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Since I have guests with an assortment of problems needing advice come here often.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.89,0:05:21.01,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.18,0:05:27.73,Default,Yuk,0,0,0,,If it's all right, would you share what happened between Sunohara-san and the Soccer Team?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.56,0:05:30.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Can I, Mei-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.03,0:05:36.86,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He started a fight when he was a freshman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.53,0:05:45.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Our school's Soccer Team has a tradition of underclassmen being hazed by upperclassmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.70,0:05:49.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The hierarchy within the team is atrocious.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.34,0:05:59.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Apparently Sunohara couldn't stand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.68,0:06:06.06,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The first time I met him was then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.64,0:06:13.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I got in a fight somewhere else and bumped into him near the faculty room, and we've been hanging out since.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.36,0:06:15.61,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I never knew that part.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.19,0:06:20.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Because of the fight, the team had to withdraw from the rookie tournament that year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.91,0:06:23.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sunohara left the team afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.20,0:06:27.95,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,So the Soccer Team hasn't forgotten what happened then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.95,0:06:33.71,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,If so, would Sunohara-san be able to enjoy playing soccer in an environment like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.38,0:06:35.59,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.59,0:06:39.72,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,But soccer's the only way to get Onii-chan back to who he used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.72,0:06:45.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But there's no point in us getting worked up when he's not around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.06,0:06:48.23,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,He's so hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.06,0:06:52.44,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,Have I ever told you the story of my older brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.98,0:06:56.19,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,You have an older brother, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.19,0:07:01.95,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,My brother would not go to school; instead he'd loiter around party town and constantly get into fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.45,0:07:05.45,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,He was detained by the police several times, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.83,0:07:08.04,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Your brother was?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.04,0:07:08.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I never would have guessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.58,0:07:11.71,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,Siblings can be strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.87,0:07:15.71,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,But you like your brother, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.09,0:07:22.22,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,I used to think of him as a scary person, but I understand him well now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.22,0:07:27.97,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,He has many good traits\Nbut just can't express them well. {ep3}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.35,0:07:31.23,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,He was simply clumsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.23,0:07:34.98,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sanae-san described Sunohara like that, too, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.31,0:07:41.11,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,I think, too, that Sunohara-san has many good traits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.11,0:07:48.12,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,Even if it's not with soccer, given the chance, he'll be the brother you used to love again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.87,0:07:51.66,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,What is it like now between you and your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.66,0:07:53.62,Default,Miy,0,0,0,,We get along very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.92,0:08:04.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sunohara, what were you doing yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.59,0:08:06.93,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,It's my business what I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.30,0:08:10.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You don't care about what Mei-chan's doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.47,0:08:12.39,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Why are you even asking that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.39,0:08:13.89,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Mei was with you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.90,0:08:17.27,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'm busy taking care of matters with Sanae-san. {ep3}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.61,0:08:19.82,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I don't have time to worry about Mei. {ep3}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.78,0:08:22.78,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you seriously mean that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.53,0:08:24.57,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.57,0:08:26.20,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'll leave Mei to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.20,0:08:27.62,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Make sure you take good care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.87,0:08:30.79,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You'd better quit it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.12,0:08:32.75,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What are you angry about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.75,0:08:34.71,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I bet Mei doesn't care about me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.71,0:08:35.62,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,SUNOHARA!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.38,0:08:39.67,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Okazaki-kun! Sunohara-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.00,0:08:41.55,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,What do you think Mei-chan's doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.55,0:08:42.63,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.63,0:08:44.80,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,But I bet you and her are having a good time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.26,0:08:47.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ask the Soccer Team yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.18,0:08:50.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,They'll tell you how much she's thinking about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.97,0:08:53.85,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.85,0:08:55.02,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You're not making any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.02,0:08:57.23,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Please stop, Okazaki-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.23,0:08:59.02,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.61,0:09:02.53,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You wanna fight, Okazaki? {ep3}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.40,0:09:06.11,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Break it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.11,0:09:08.16,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,What's this about? What's the reason for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.16,0:09:10.16,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,What happened, Ryou-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.16,0:09:11.87,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.87,0:09:15.71,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun, Sunohara-kun.\NI don't think fighting is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.29,0:09:19.29,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Tomoya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.29,0:09:20.25,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.05,0:09:25.22,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Sunohara-kun, really, what is the matter here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.01,0:09:29.76,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,So you got in a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.76,0:09:32.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah. I lost my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.26,0:09:34.18,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,What's Onii-chan doing now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.18,0:09:36.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He skipped afternoon classes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.52,0:09:38.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He must have gone out to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.44,0:09:39.77,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.77,0:09:41.98,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Are you going to the Soccer Team again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.98,0:09:47.78,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Yes. After hearing Miyazawa-san's story, I feel like I have to keep trying harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.41,0:09:51.74,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I can go alone, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.74,0:09:55.41,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I can't trouble you any more with this sibling matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.41,0:09:57.62,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,It's no trouble at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.62,0:10:00.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No. Nagisa, you go on home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.21,0:10:02.38,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.38,0:10:05.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You know what kind of a bunch the Soccer Team is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.01,0:10:07.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We don't know how the meeting may get twisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.26,0:10:09.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Just Mei-chan and I should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.55,0:10:11.18,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I won't allow that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.18,0:10:13.81,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I can't let just the two of you go after hearing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.81,0:10:16.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What would you do if they started to get violent?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.31,0:10:19.85,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If it turns into a fight, I won't be able to cover you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.23,0:10:26.48,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,If that happens, I'll run away with Mei-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.48,0:10:30.78,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Even if anything were to happen to you,\Nif I'm there, I can get Mei-chan out of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.45,0:10:36.29,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You really are stubborn when it comes to something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:40.37,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,You guys really don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.37,0:10:42.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We're asking knowing it's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.54,0:10:46.13,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Please let Sunohara-san back on the team!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.13,0:10:48.30,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,It's fine if he can't play in the games.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.30,0:10:50.51,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Just letting him participate in practice is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.51,0:10:54.60,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Hey! Do you see anything in it for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.60,0:10:57.52,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,We'll just get an extra obstacle on the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.52,0:11:00.94,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,If there's anything I can help with, please let me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.94,0:11:01.90,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I'll do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.85,0:11:05.32,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Captain, let's start practicing already.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.32,0:11:08.28,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Forget about them and please get over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.28,0:11:08.86,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.86,0:11:10.49,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.49,0:11:12.41,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We know we're being unreasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.41,0:11:14.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But please!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.03,0:11:14.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We're begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.79,0:11:20.00,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.00,0:11:23.12,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I never imagined Okazaki would beg like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.12,0:11:26.75,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,I heard that you'd changed recently, but I guess the rumor was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.17,0:11:28.38,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Okazaki-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.05,0:11:31.63,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Go be a ball boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.01,0:11:33.72,Default,2,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.89,0:11:36.60,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, Okazaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.60,0:11:38.68,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,That was very admirable of you, Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.68,0:11:40.14,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It wasn't much.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.14,0:11:42.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Rather than that, let's do our best as ball boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.27,0:11:43.02,Default,2,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.87,0:11:59.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't overexert yourself, since you're not very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.33,0:12:00.33,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.33,0:12:03.04,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Please watch out for Mei-chan over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.33,0:12:06.50,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Go get it, ball boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.50,0:12:07.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'll go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.17,0:12:12.59,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Don't space out, ball boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.59,0:12:13.55,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.22,0:12:17.05,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Get a move on, airhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.76,0:12:18.76,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.39,0:12:25.81,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,You dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.81,0:12:27.86,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Bring it back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.77,0:12:29.82,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.40,0:12:32.49,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,There goes another!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.49,0:12:35.20,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Come on! Hurry and go get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.20,0:12:35.91,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.41,0:12:38.20,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Move faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.53,0:12:39.70,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.70,0:12:40.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,They're doing it on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.99,0:12:42.83,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Tired already?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.38,0:12:52.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa, Mei-chan, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.51,0:12:53.47,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.47,0:12:55.63,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I'm fine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.47,0:13:01.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You guys catch your breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.89,0:13:05.39,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Mei-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.40,0:13:08.65,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Mei-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.11,0:13:11.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Those guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.07,0:13:15.45,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,No. It's because I wasn't paying attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.45,0:13:17.20,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Mei-chan, you should...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.99,0:13:19.45,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.45,0:13:21.58,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,That was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.58,0:13:26.41,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Stop wasting time, trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.71,0:13:27.58,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.92,0:13:37.22,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.59,0:13:39.22,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.22,0:13:41.72,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Um, where did the other members go?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.72,0:13:42.68,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,They went home.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.47,0:13:46.31,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Practice is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.31,0:13:49.69,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,We'll listen to what you guys have to say for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.27,0:13:52.07,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,So, what did you guys want?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.65,0:13:55.24,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,About my brother, Sunohara Youhei.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.24,0:13:57.07,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,We would like you to let him back on the team.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.07,0:13:59.20,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Ah, sorry. Don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.20,0:14:05.20,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Who would let a pest like your brother onto the team?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.20,0:14:07.29,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,He is a wuss, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.29,0:14:10.83,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,A loser that just barks when he's got no balls to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.13,0:14:15.46,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,A dropout that quit soccer and can't study for beans either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.21,0:14:20.18,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Where's the reason in helping a piece of trash like him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.18,0:14:21.55,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,How could you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.55,0:14:22.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.35,0:14:30.14,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Did you guys know that Sunohara knows what you guys are doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.81,0:14:33.82,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Apparently he asked one of our younger guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.82,0:14:34.82,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,But so what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.82,0:14:37.53,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Your brother didn't show up at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.53,0:14:39.28,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,You've been ignored.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.28,0:14:44.16,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Despite what his sister's doing for him, he got scared of us and ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.16,0:14:47.33,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,He is a hopeless piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.75,0:14:50.46,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Mei-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.46,0:14:52.38,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Aw, you made her cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.38,0:14:54.34,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,You're becoming an eyesore now. Go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.34,0:14:56.17,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,No... No...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.17,0:14:57.76,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Onii-chan will come.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.76,0:14:59.09,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,He'll definitely come.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.09,0:15:00.72,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,What won't come won't come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.72,0:15:02.72,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,He will. Onii-chan will.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.72,0:15:06.14,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,He'll definitely come save Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.81,0:15:07.60,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Mei-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.60,0:15:09.68,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Huh? Is she an absolute moron?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.68,0:15:12.69,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,She is Sunohara's sister, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.69,0:15:16.44,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Here, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.44,0:15:21.15,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,If you don't scream louder,\Nyour dear Onii-chan won't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.77,0:15:18.15,Default-alt,Mei,0,0,0,,It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.19,0:15:21.15,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.53,0:15:22.66,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.66,0:15:23.36,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.91,0:15:26.03,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,You want to start a fight with all of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.03,0:15:27.62,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Cry louder.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.03,0:15:28.45,Default-alt,Mei,0,0,0,,Th-That hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.45,0:15:30.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You scum.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.54,0:15:31.54,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.54,0:15:36.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sorry, Nagisa. I was planning on holding it in for Mei-chan's sake, but I'm at my limits!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.34,0:15:40.59,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.42,0:15:43.80,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Come on! Cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.06,0:15:56.19,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Don't make Mei cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.44,0:16:01.82,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I won't forgive anyone who makes Mei cry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.82,0:16:02.65,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Why you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.70,0:16:07.99,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.99,0:16:08.70,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sunohara-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.46,0:16:17.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nagisa, take care of Mei-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.88,0:16:18.59,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.59,0:16:20.92,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Onii-chan! Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.17,0:16:22.22,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't forget I'm here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.65,0:16:38.73,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,You guys are insane...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.11,0:16:41.03,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,They've got crazy eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.11,0:16:44.65,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Okazaki... Did we win?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.20,0:16:46.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.61,0:16:48.57,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But I don't think we lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.41,0:16:51.45,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.91,0:16:53.33,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Who are you calling an idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.79,0:16:56.25,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Who else other than you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.38,0:17:00.00,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Apologize to Mei-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.34,0:17:02.42,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.42,0:17:06.43,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,This never would have happened if you'd kept yourself right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.18,0:17:08.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You really are a worthless brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.51,0:17:11.68,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Are you picking a fight with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.27,0:17:14.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Basically.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.57,0:17:22.86,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.86,0:17:24.07,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Sunohara-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.07,0:17:26.61,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Stop! Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.04,0:17:37.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You flaming idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.00,0:17:44.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you have any clue what Mei-chan went through because of you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.71,0:17:47.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You have to be the one to look after her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.14,0:17:50.01,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Why you...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.01,0:17:52.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're Mei-chan's brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.01,0:17:54.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Think more of Mei-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.22,0:17:54.97,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.97,0:17:56.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't lie to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.31,0:18:00.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She was hooking up to a guy like me,\Nand you didn't do anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.77,0:18:02.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You didn't worry about her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.36,0:18:03.27,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.27,0:18:04.44,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I sure did!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.44,0:18:06.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then why did you leave her?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.74,0:18:08.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If you have an excuse, say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.61,0:18:10.95,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I thought it was fine if it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.33,0:18:16.87,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I was planning on hiding and watching to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.54,0:18:20.17,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,But because you were being so pathetic, I had to come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.17,0:18:22.42,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun! Sunohara-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.42,0:18:24.34,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Please stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.34,0:18:26.67,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You should have protected Mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.30,0:18:29.47,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Isn't that the boyfriend's role?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.47,0:18:30.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.89,0:18:32.18,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Sunohara!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.76,0:18:37.73,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You love Mei enough to break up with Nagisa-chan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.73,0:18:39.98,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Then get your goddamn act together!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.31,0:18:43.94,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Onii-chan! Okazaki-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.94,0:18:46.44,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Please stop this, both of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.15,0:18:49.28,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Nagisa-chan? Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.24,0:18:52.41,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You've done it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.70,0:18:54.33,Default-alt,Mei,0,0,0,,Stop it! Please stop it now, Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.33,0:18:56.45,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,Onii-chan! Onii-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.79,0:18:59.25,Default,Mei,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.62,0:19:00.41,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Mei...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.35,0:19:19.35,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you take a day off from school?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.35,0:19:23.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Aren't you the one who's still tired?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.65,0:19:25.86,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,No. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.09,0:19:50.30,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,What happened to your eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.30,0:19:51.38,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,They look horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.38,0:19:53.09,Default,Kot,0,0,0,,But they look like they're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.18,0:20:02.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We got a letter from Mei-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.10,0:20:04.35,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Not just a phone call, but a letter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.35,0:20:06.86,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,She really has a keen sense of duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.86,0:20:09.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She asked me to take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.69,0:20:14.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,And she also said she wants to find great friends just like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.32,0:20:19.49,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's often said that you're forever stuck with the friends you make during your school days.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.12,0:20:24.75,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I bet now's the only time you can do stupid things like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.21,0:20:26.17,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.88,0:20:30.09,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Just six more months left at this high school, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.38,0:20:36.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,There's the old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.97,0:20:39.47,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Crap. I'm starting to get really nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.47,0:20:40.89,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you want to stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.27,0:20:42.35,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,No, I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.35,0:20:45.69,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Since the only woman I love is Sanae-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.40,0:20:48.23,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Okay. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.02,0:20:51.03,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.03,0:20:53.69,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Oh, ah... Sunohara, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.69,0:20:55.57,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,What? Are you here to buy bread?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.57,0:20:58.87,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Father! Please give Sanae-san to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.45,0:21:02.75,Default,San,0,0,0,,What's going on, Akio-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.45,0:21:04.50,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,"Akio-san"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.50,0:21:09.67,Default,Nag,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun, you haven't told Sunohara-san about Mom yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.67,0:21:11.25,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,"M-Mom"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.25,0:21:11.75,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.75,0:21:14.51,Default,San,0,0,0,,Akio-san is my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.80,0:21:20.35,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,You sunuva... You dare touch my woman?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.35,0:21:22.35,Default,Aki,0,0,0,,Hold it right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.10,0:21:28.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was remembering the first time I met Sunohara.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.53,0:21:43.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,He was a weird blond guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.70,0:21:46.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I cracked up just looking at his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.42,0:21:50.75,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It was my first time laughing so much since coming to this school.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.75,0:21:55.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I wanted to try doing stupid things with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.38,0:22:01.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,From the day we met, we've hung out ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.60,0:22:04.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,And even now...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.27,0:22:06.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We're still smiling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.70,0:22:26.20,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}mi{\kf32}tsu{\kf23}me{\kf23}te {\kf19}i{\kf137}ta {\kf29}na{\kf28}ga{\kf21}re{\kf69}ru {\kf60}ku{\kf61}mo {\kf230}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.70,0:22:26.20,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I was gazing at the drifting clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.20,0:22:33.25,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}{\kf40}ka{\kf11}n{\kf24}ji{\kf21}te {\kf30}i{\kf135}ta {\kf28}ka{\kf23}wa{\kf19}ru {\kf68}so{\kf63}ra {\kf37}no {\kf45}i{\kf26}ro {\kf130}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.20,0:22:33.25,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(0,250)}I was feeling the changes in the sky's colour.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.75,0:22:41.30,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf25}ta{\kf31}chi {\kf20}to{\kf27}ma{\kf21}t{\kf142}ta {\kf22}bo{\kf23}ku{\kf26}ra {\kf66}wa {\kf63}ki{\kf59}zu{\kf229}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.75,0:22:41.30,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}As we stop walking,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.30,0:22:48.39,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf24}u{\kf32}tsu{\kf25}ro{\kf21}i {\kf20}yu{\kf143}ku {\kf24}se{\kf25}ka{\kf23}i {\kf65}ga {\kf73}tsu{\kf26}mu{\kf49}gu {\kf18}u{\kf32}ta {\kf113}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.30,0:22:48.39,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}we hear the song the world sings as its colours fade.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.39,0:22:55.69,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf91}no{\kf35}ba{\kf38}shi{\kf139}ta {\kf48}yu{\kf25}bi {\kf44}de {\kf29}ta{\kf90}gu{\kf24}ru {\kf44}yo{\kf24}u {\kf98}ni
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.39,0:22:55.69,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Just as you scan with the fingers you spread,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.69,0:23:04.33,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf26}ta{\kf92}da {\kf34}hi{\kf38}to{\kf87}tsu {\kf55}ka{\kf44}wa{\kf23}ra{\kf48}na{\kf29}i {\kf44}mo{\kf47}no {\kf22}sa{\kf95}ga{\kf177}su
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.69,0:23:04.33,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I search for the one thing that never changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.37,0:23:11.92,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf59}ka{\kf41}za{\kf74}su {\kf72}te {\kf138}ni {\kf46}to{\kf45}mo{\kf75}shi{\kf73}bi {\kf136}wo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.37,0:23:11.92,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}Let there be a torch in the hand you reach out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.92,0:23:19.47,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf46}a{\kf52}su {\kf72}he {\kf24}to {\kf46}tsu{\kf25}zu{\kf108}ku {\kf44}chi{\kf33}i{\kf26}sa{\kf61}na {\kf78}shi{\kf71}ru{\kf73}be
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.92,0:23:19.47,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}There'll be a small silhouette leading to tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.47,0:23:27.01,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf44}i{\kf52}ma {\kf70}mo {\kf67}ma{\kf144}da {\kf45}ko{\kf46}da{\kf63}ma {\kf80}su{\kf140}ru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.47,0:23:27.01,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The word you said that day...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.01,0:23:34.52,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf48}a{\kf46}no {\kf70}hi {\kf27}no {\kf44}ko{\kf26}to{\kf104}ba {\kf51}chi{\kf30}ka{\kf27}i {\kf93}ni {\kf71}ka{\kf113}e
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.01,0:23:34.52,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}...still echoes in my head, and let's make it an oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.52,0:23:39.78,ED Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\kf42}bo{\kf34}ku {\kf18}wa {\kf166}yu{\kf266}ku
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.52,0:23:39.78,ED English,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I will continue going with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.78,0:23:43.74,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fs99.999996\fad(0,400)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,470.000015)\blur0.5\bord0.75\3c&H000000&}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.11,0:23:43.07,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,Yeah, what a coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.45,0:23:45.49,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,You know, if you don't mind-
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.49,0:23:46.53,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Who's he?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.16,0:23:49.04,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Looks like he's from a different school.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.16,0:23:51.96,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,...because of you, he misunderstood!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.96,0:23:55.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,There are a lot of guys who are fans of yours in my class, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.33,0:23:57.92,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,It's great that I'm liked,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.25,0:24:01.84,Default,Mis,0,0,0,,but I don't know what they see in a woman who only yells.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.84,0:24:05.22,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,In this dirty boy's dorm,\Nyou've become an idol-like figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.22,0:24:07.64,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Like a jewel in a dunghill.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.68,0:24:09.64,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\4c&H000000&\shad3\pos(960,405)\bord0.75\blur0.5\3c&H00000A&}Episode 5
